@startuml
title SplitSmart expense submission
actor Submitter
participant "Expense use case" as UC
participant "Authorization policy" as Auth
participant "Allocation service" as Alloc
participant "Expense repository" as Repo
participant "Notification port" as Notify
Submitter -> UC: submit expense
UC -> Auth: verify active group member
Auth --> UC: allowed/denied
UC -> Alloc: validate and calculate shares
Alloc --> UC: ordered shares or error
UC -> Repo: save PENDING expense
Repo --> UC: saved
UC -> Notify: notify other active members
Notify --> UC: delivery result
UC --> Submitter: pending confirmation
@enduml
